ve access to one free lootbox every 20 hours.\n❕Some gamepasses are not visible on this page, though you can purchase them via the in-game shop.\n\n🎧Headphones are recommended.\n\n🔦Having flashlight issues? Lower your graphics quality to level 1-4 to enable the lo-fi flashlight.\n\nSome tags: slenderman, horror, survival, classic, survivors, pages, stop it slender 2, survive, stalker, killer, proxy, vr","path":"/game/30869879-egghunt-stop-it-slender-2","slug":"30869879-egghunt-stop-it-slender-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e36a935e88ae75d524f6329fcec5d4f460a6b4c75d8a39187f392c16c26a2d9a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e195c249b0161234b6770d504226de45/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":15,"visitor":181537563,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-24T15:18:17.150Z","creator":{"name":"Kinnis97","type":"User"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8963721566,"name":"Backrooms: Desolation","desc":"Mark your territory in Backrooms: Desolation! Enter an unknown section of The Complex's never-ending superstructure and contribute to Reymond's research.\n\nU - Toggle Mouse Lock\nF - Flashlight\nT - Equip Gun\nG - View Cameras\nZ - Prone\nC - Crouch\nE - Grab Object\nShift - Sprint\nShift + C - Slide\nX - Toggle view (drone and focus)\nQ - Actions\n\nThis experience requires a high-end device to run smoothly, but offers a low-detail mode for low-end devices.\n\nTAGS (IGNORE): Backrooms, Hotel, Horror, Phobia, Creature, Shadow, Found Footage, Creepy, The backrooms, backrooms, kv31, KV-31  K. Pixels, Kan e Pixels, Pool Rooms, liminal spaces, desolation, exploration, adventure, survival, Kane Pixels, Async, RP, Roleplay","path":"/game/8963721566-backrooms-desolation","slug":"8963721566-backrooms-desolation","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ae7a018d997210c163bfa97f885a169348d137824141a316f792774b0ab0e1c1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-14c4514850bc6b7b1da84941b440b272/150/150/Image/Png/n